# CloudNativePG PostgreSQL HA baseline images
# Source of truth for the recommended non-Bitnami PostgreSQL HA path used by k8s-mystical-mesh oppostgres.
#
# Helm chart alignment:
#   cloudnative-pg chart 0.29.0 -> appVersion 1.30.0
#   plugin-barman-cloud chart 0.7.0 -> appVersion v0.13.0
#
# Runtime notes:
#   - The CloudNativePG operator image is required for the cnpg-system operator deployment.
#   - PostgreSQL 17.6 is the primary target for the Keycloak oppostgres HA cluster.
#   - PostgreSQL 18.4 is retained as a forward-compatible CNPG catalog image, but Keycloak should use 17.x unless intentionally upgraded.
#   - PgBouncer is included for optional CNPG Pooler resources.
#   - Barman Cloud plugin images are included for backup/restore readiness.
#   - postgres:17 is used by the local verification/test-client pod in the k8s-mystical-mesh bundle.
#   - busybox is included as a small utility image for air-gapped troubleshooting jobs.

ghcr.io/cloudnative-pg/cloudnative-pg:1.30.0
ghcr.io/cloudnative-pg/postgresql:17.6-system-trixie
ghcr.io/cloudnative-pg/postgresql:18.4-system-trixie
ghcr.io/cloudnative-pg/pgbouncer:1.25.1
ghcr.io/cloudnative-pg/plugin-barman-cloud:v0.13.0
ghcr.io/cloudnative-pg/plugin-barman-cloud-sidecar:v0.13.0
docker.io/postgres:17.6
docker.io/busybox:1.37.0
